test interpret
test run
target aarch64

; More than 4096 values live at once: the allocator's frame area exceeds 32 KiB, so slots
; beyond it are addressed through x16 (`slotStoreAt`/`slotLoadAt`, V5). The popcnt gives
; float-class vregs, so the spill allocator (`--regalloc spill`) also has float slots
; beyond 64 KiB.

